      "text": "Six interdictions. 12,000+ pounds of illegal drugs. $141 million street value. These drugs were seized during SIX interdictions conducted by multiple Coast Guard crews and teams, as well as Royal Dutch and Royal Canadian Navy partners.  Just another Thursday offload for the crew of CGC Valiant. The Coast Guard continues to work with @DHSgov and national partners to detect, deter, and interdict illegal migration, drug smuggling, and other terrorist or hostile activity before it reaches our border. Our operations across the southern border and maritime approaches are directly impacting cartels and Transnational Criminal Organizations seeking to traffic fentanyl into the U.S.\n\n@jiatfs @USCGLANTAREA @DefensieCarib @RoyalCanNavy @CBPAMO @DEAHQ @USCGSoutheast    #ProtectingOurBorders #DrugInterdiction #SemperParatus #AlwaysReady #CoastGuard",
      "text_resolved": "Six interdictions. 12,000+ pounds of illegal drugs. $141 million street value. These drugs were seized during SIX interdictions conducted by multiple Coast Guard crews and teams, as well as Royal Dutch and Royal Canadian Navy partners.  Just another Thursday offload for the crew of CGC Valiant. The Coast Guard continues to work with @DHSgov and national partners to detect, deter, and interdict illegal migration, drug smuggling, and other terrorist or hostile activity before it reaches our border. Our operations across the southern border and maritime approaches are directly impacting cartels and Transnational Criminal Organizations seeking to traffic fentanyl into the U.S.\n\n@jiatfs @USCGLANTAREA @DefensieCarib @RoyalCanNavy @CBPAMO @DEAHQ @USCGSoutheast    #ProtectingOurBorders #DrugInterdiction #SemperParatus #AlwaysReady #CoastGuard",
