      "text": "The U.S. Coast Guard Cutter Polar Star and crew departed the Antarctic region Tuesday, after 65 days south of the Antarctic Circle in support of Operation Deep Freeze 2025. As the United States’ only heavy icebreaker, Polar Star is instrumental in providing access to both Polar Regions. Sustained Coast Guard presence in the Arctic and Antarctic – facilitated by a robust icebreaker fleet – is critical to advancing U.S. national, economic, and energy security. \n\n@DHSgov \n \nRead more here: https://t.co/9qdAOIezIC\n \n#PolarStar #IceBreaking #NationalSecurity #USCG #EconomicStability",
      "text_resolved": "The U.S. Coast Guard Cutter Polar Star and crew departed the Antarctic region Tuesday, after 65 days south of the Antarctic Circle in support of Operation Deep Freeze 2025. As the United States’ only heavy icebreaker, Polar Star is instrumental in providing access to both Polar Regions. Sustained Coast Guard presence in the Arctic and Antarctic – facilitated by a robust icebreaker fleet – is critical to advancing U.S. national, economic, and energy security. \n\n@DHSgov \n \nRead more here: https://www.news.uscg.mil/Press-Releases/Article/4112057/us-coast-guard-cutter-polar-stars-crew-concludes-operation-deep-freeze-2025-mis/\n \n#PolarStar #IceBreaking #NationalSecurity #USCG #EconomicStability",
